ision with you to draw myself in a similar way. I love apple pie and macaron. I hope can lay down on the plate and read books.  You can change the clothing , style and pose if  you have any idea.\n\nHamtsu Ringo\n出身地：地下\n種族:地下人\n属性：中立\n性別：女 印象:賢い,可愛い？\nspecial point：Right eye is made by Diamond\n仕事：語り部, 錬金術師\n趣味：ポーションを作る, 読書, 鉱石コレクション,ハーブ，ハムスターと遊ぶ,\n要素: 薬, ハムスター, 文学 蝶ネクタイ\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yyOT07yL_5XV0R50QJJ4QoPJKWf_BZSj?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@roQcho/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1957335, "client_id": 158847, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3bb28ec6/uploads/origins/95d9f908-bb31-416e-b12d-9f4b2ad4bf83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=912866634720599a8b4170e9b831d304", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3bb28ec6/uploads/origins/95d9f908-bb31-416e-b12d-9f4b2ad4bf83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=912866634720599a8b4170e9b831d304, https://si.imgix.net/3bb28ec6/uploads/origins/95d9f908-bb31-416e-b12d-9f4b2ad4bf83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=acbfb1b22f7c7cb244462186d8f61ce0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3bb28ec6/uploads/origins/95d9f908-bb31-416e-b12d-9f4b2ad4bf83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e0aa4f4e2774853f5bb28463522fa57 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3bb28ec6/uploads/origins/95d9f908-bb31-416e-b12d-9f4b2ad4bf83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3bf7c4bb8158e8b5ad8569d75cd87ee5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3bb28ec6/uploads/origins/95d9f908-bb31-416e-b12d-9f4b2ad4bf83?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&cr